## Security Implementation

### Authentication
- Kafka SASL authentication (configurable)
- Database password authentication
- Health endpoints JWT authentication (documented)

### Authorization
- RBAC for admin endpoints (documented)
- Health endpoints require authentication (documented)

### Data Privacy
- NO LLM in calculation path (mandatory)
- Sanitized logging
- Secure credential handling
- Customer_id in all queries (tenant isolation)

### Network Security
- TLS for Kafka connections (configurable)
- TLS for database connections (configurable)

